  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO (France) for Freedom of Expression and Safety of Journalists Secti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the authority of Chief, CI/FEJ and the guidance of relevant colleagues, the JPO will contribute to the Section&apos;s activities to promote freedom of expression and the safety of journalists, with a focus on freedom of expression in the digital ecosystem. This will include a human rights-based approach to countering hate speech and mis- and disinformation; protecting the digital safety of journalists, particularly women journalists; and promoting transparency, human rights due diligence, and regulatory principles for digital platforms. The JPO will support the Section in producing and coordinating the World Trends in Freedom of Expression and Media Development series (World Trends Report).</narrative>
  </description>
